<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad is deploying troops to secure Kurdistan borders after the top court authorized a military presence and takeover of border posts and oil fields, while the prime minister seeks greater authority over the Kurdish region and the defense ministry orders nationwide troop deployment and closure of oil smuggling routes. Iraqi drone strikes have destroyed a militant vehicle in Anbar province and Hezbollah fighters have been transferred onto Popular Mobilization Forces payroll. Germany arrested an Iraqi duo suspected of plotting attacks on synagogues, and an Iraqi court sentenced eight French nationals to life imprisonment for IS group membership. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPT2MxVEJYVHRnSDRQZzRETWUyMnlCYUJDTTVTVzNuenBwRkRKeTgxZnBDR0VUVWt4akRiYzdMSnc5Sk9PWTBUMy00UFNBeUxsU0F1T1dzcFM2QkFuYTJINzZ1WmJzYUxaZnJoM3U1Q1k3N1JjLXZyQ29TS3IwZ1EwQU0yaXVNcnk0Y3ZIWDFuSzlOekJjb0RyMzdBR1N6TXJITGtzM09PQ2s4Ujg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPcFBlZXpjNmxudmFiTnBwb3VTalZDY1JoR3FaYUpabkNycXJfS2x0aDR4Z2NLNEtyRVowTXVIN1BzR1NMZjhBaU9GUzc4RTBUYWZHTFh4NS03dGQxc2lxQnlBQmNkWnVrdFJKU2lwQjc4OUl5VTVYVHlFWGdPT3QtQUN6dFRnZnNXaDRyLTU4ZGt5cUVPeWhISTdUU0ZHTWNzZDktRTZFUFFBckJ2cGIxcWVwRG5mc2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPOVlXbldqYUR1T2duLTgwMnZnNkhOeE1SbE1lV2gzMmxSMlZTeGtSVktDdFNJX19BdWxnUHFremN6RWtiUTJpaVlBZ3h1MG1aT1luLXZpZUx2Rms3TDVwcWdWV184T3FtQ0xWdTNQM1Z0S2cxdEI4RGxQbzhvck53ejBfd3JEWmlEWEVzTnI0dmM2MnZCUHZKUGVMQy16RXBBV2V3a3Jid